            - message_level : int {0, 1, 2, 4, 7}
                Verbosity level, corresponds to:

                    - ``0``: ``ML_NONE``
                        All messaging to stdout is supressed.

                    - ``1``: ``ML_VERBOSE``
                        Includes a once-per-iteration report on simplex/ipm
