                    - ``0``:  ``SIMPLEX_SCALE_STRATEGY_OFF``
                    - ``1``: ``SIMPLEX_SCALE_STRATEGY_HIGHS``
                    - ``2``: ``SIMPLEX_SCALE_STRATEGY_HIGHS_FORCED``
